{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11208240","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11208240","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1120824001:1":{"text":"毒液を提出してくださるのですか？","source_cn":"您要提交悬赏物吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE4F93ABE92E338B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1120824001":{"text":"毒液を提出してくださるのですか？","source_cn":"您要提交悬赏物吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE4F93ABE92E338B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120824002:1":{"text":"対象物を受け取りました。確認させていただきます。","source_cn":"标的物已收到，请待我查验。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BF72B1B4AD303EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:6:1120824003:0":{"text":"確認中…","source_cn":"正在检查","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9042664EADBA1B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120824004:1":{"text":"……間違いありません。あなたが採取してくださったのは、クリムゾン高原にいるポイズンアラクネの毒液です。","source_cn":"……检验无误。您确实取回了深红高原的诡蛛毒液。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46540E9FE57CD32E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120824005:1":{"text":"ほ、本当にクリアした！","source_cn":"竟、竟然真的通过了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x414B1532A17A6962","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120824006:1":{"text":"では、二つ目の要求は……","source_cn":"那么，第二个悬赏要求是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBAF21E8592415EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120824007:1":{"text":"……執事さん、待ってください！まだあるんですか？","source_cn":"——等等，执事老爷！之前的悬赏条件都满足了，怎么还有下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C41D2065F0489E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120824008:1":{"text":"コウボウ様からは、三つの試練を通過したお方に残陽の目をお渡しするよう仰せつかっております。","source_cn":"荒矛老爷的要求如此。等三项考验达成后，才能将残阳之眼给各位。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2A592DE973158F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120824009:1":{"text":"……あのねぇ、執事さん。残陽の目のようないいものが本当にあるのなら、まずはあっしらに見せてくださいよ。","source_cn":"……我说执事老爷，既然真有残阳之眼那种好东西，就先给我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x153BDA980E7CB4CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120824010:1":{"text":"コウボウ様の言ったルールに反するわけでもないですし、依頼を受ける身としてはさらにやる気がでますからね！そうでなきゃいくらうまい話を並べられても、賞品を見ることなく三つの要求も応えるなんて無理な話ですよ……","source_cn":"看看又没有违背荒矛老爷的规定，而且还能让接悬赏的人更有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85B2A5484943176B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120824011:0":{"text":"……そうですか、ではどうぞ。これが残陽の目です。","source_cn":"……既然如此，请看。这就是残阳之眼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBF0D529F26D6A4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:15::0":{"text":"残陽の目","source_cn":"残阳之眼","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CF0B19E03F50B0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1120824012:1":{"text":"なんて綺麗なルビーなんでしょう……！","source_cn":"好美丽的红宝石……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A10B45EC16E3937","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120824013:0":{"text":"……この透明度と炎のような彩は、間違いなく残陽の目ですね……","source_cn":"……这种通透度和火彩，确实是残阳之眼没错啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CD6453EFEDEB7F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1120824014:0":{"text":"<male>旦那さん</male><female>お嬢さん</female>、この依頼は絶対にやり遂げましょう。こんな機会は二度とないですよ。","source_cn":"<male>老爷</male><female>小姐</...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2DF34A47C97BA93A","